Why this first
Double tops and bottoms map neatly into code because the logic is mostly geometric and objective: swing identification, peak/trough similarity, neckline placement, and breakout confirmation. The source also emphasizes that the neckline break is the best entry point and that the trade should wait for confirmation rather than reacting early.
What I’d build first
