Pattern validator for peak/trough similarity within a configurable tolerance.
Neckline generator.
Candle-close breakout filter.
Candlestick confirmation score using Hammer, Engulfing, and Pin Top.
Risk module with SL at the invalidation swing and 1:2 take profit.
Partial close at 1:2, then break-even plus trailing stop on the runner.
Suggested spec
For the first version, keep the rules strict:
Require two confirmed swings with a minimum bar separation.
Require the second top/bottom to be within a percentage tolerance of the first.
Require a clean neckline break on candle close, not wick touch.
Require confirmation from the breakout candle or the next candle.
Place stop loss beyond the invalidation swing.
Split exits into 50% at 1:2 and 50% managed by break-even plus trailing stop.
